  "releaseNotes": "v2.2.0: Complete LOLCODE v1.2 mathematical operators, conditional statements, boolean logic, and IT variable system. Added comprehensive mathematical operations (SUM, DIFF, PRODUKT, QUOSHUNT, MOD, BIGGR, SMALLR), full conditional flow control (O RLY?, MEBBE, NO WAI), boolean operators (BOTH OF, EITHER OF, WON OF, NOT), infinite loop protection, and expanded to 136 comprehensive tests. Production-ready with robust parsing and clean C# code generation.",
